Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- On-Screen Keyboard (sg-osk). Wine has no osk.exe; wine-sg's
; system32 launcher (patch 0181), explorer's Win+Ctrl+O, `osk` in the Run box
; and ShellExecute find ours here.
;
; The path is the package's install location reached through Z:. If Z: is ever
; removed from the prefix for isolation, this must move with it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\App Paths\osk.exe]
@="Z:\\usr\\libexec\\stained-glass\\shell\\sg-osk64.exe"
